                                "sense_id": "be88684d-5b8b-3733-b865-ca384b0f3a24",
                                "text": "And still I was diddling with the engine, fifteen, twenty, thirty, sixty pulls of the starting cord, fiddling with the choke, halfway, full choke, close choke, and flooding it, and waiting for it to unflood."
